Alacritty terminal emulator themes for {{ theme.name }}. {{ theme.description }}

## Installation

{% if adapter.mirror -%}
Clone the repository and copy the theme files:

```bash
git clone https://github.com/{{ adapter.mirror }}.git
cp {{ repo }}/*.toml ~/.config/alacritty/themes/
```
{% else -%}
Copy the theme files:

```bash
cp *.toml ~/.config/alacritty/themes/
```
{% endif %}
Then import the theme in your `alacritty.toml`:

```toml
[general]
import = ["~/.config/alacritty/themes/{{ theme.id }}-{{ first.variant.id }}.toml"]
```
{% for v in variants | slice(start=1) %}
Or for {{ v.variant.id }}:

```toml
[general]
import = ["~/.config/alacritty/themes/{{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}.toml"]
```
{% endfor %}
## Variants

{% for v in variants -%}
- **{{ theme.id }}-{{ v.variant.id }}** - {{ v.variant.description }}
{% endfor -%}
